WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.067
The request: “Make room for my laptop: clear the space in front of it”

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.200
SAM 3.1: Finds every object on your photo

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Muse Spark: Writes the edit for this exact photo

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.933
Muse Image: Develops 3 versions of the after photo

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:16.800
SAM 3.1: Checks every object in every version

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.200
Muse Spark: Picks the version that follows the request

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:26.200
The after photo: It is the plan you approve before a robot touches anything

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.200
Muse Spark: Gives each move to a robot that can do it, or says why not

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.200
SAM 3D Objects · twin: Robots rehearse on SAM 3D bodies; every object is measured
